Added the `FederatedInstance` registry, with list and detail views, a read-only REST API endpoint, a GraphQL type and a home page panel, listing every instance of the federation with its role, last publish, last pull, versions and published document counts. Every successful sync job writes the instance's heartbeat to MongoDB and refreshes the registry from all heartbeats, and the `Nautobot instances` picker on the `MongoDB to Nautobot` job now reads the registry instead of querying MongoDB on every form render.
